## 📊 Key Analysis Areas

| Analysis Type | Description |
|--------------|-------------|
| Location Analysis | Study geographic coordinates and locations |
| Distance Analysis | Calculate distances between points |
| Spatial Clustering | Group nearby geographic locations |
| Heatmaps | Visualize data density across regions |
| Route Analysis | Identify optimal paths and routes |
| Regional Comparison | Compare geographic regions |

## 🔍 Project Modules

### 1. Data Collection
- Gather geographic datasets.
- Import coordinates and location information.

### 2. Data Cleaning & Validation
- Handle missing coordinate values.
- Remove duplicate records.
- Validate latitude and longitude ranges.
- Standardize geographic data formats.

### 3. Spatial Analysis
- Distance calculations
- Proximity analysis
- Spatial relationships
- Regional trend analysis

### 4. Map Visualization
- Interactive maps
- Marker-based visualization
- Heatmaps
- Choropleth maps

### 5. Reporting Module
- Geographic insights
- Regional performance reports
- Spatial trend summaries

## 📈 Expected Outcomes
- Geographic trend identification
- Improved location-based decision making
- Better resource allocation
- Enhanced spatial understanding
- Actionable geographic insights

## ▶️ Installation

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/Geospatial-Data-Analysis.git
```

Navigate to the project directory:

```bash
cd Geospatial-Data-Analysis
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## ▶️ Usage

Run the application:

```bash
python main.py
```

